# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout, regardless of the platform's
# git config (Windows' git defaults to converting LF -> CRLF on checkout, which then fails
# `prettier --check` — prettier's default `endOfLine` is "lf" — even though the committed source
# is untouched; this is the CI-only fix, not a change to any tracked file's content).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.onnx binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
